  return [];\n}\n```\n- **Constants**: 1 (`0`)\n- **Bindings**: 1 (`cells`)\n- **Invocations**: 1 (`cells.length`)\n- **Conditionals**: 1 (`if`)\n- **Loops**: 0\n- **Assignments**: 0  \n→ **Total Mass**: (1×1) + (1×1) + (1×2) + (1×4) = 1 + 1 + 2 + 4 = **8**\n\n- **Mass Change**: 1 → 8 (+7)\n- **Justification**: Intentional trade-off — increased mass is acceptable because **Rule 2 (Reveals Intent) takes precedence over APP mass minimization**.\n\n### Summary:\nRefactoring improves code clarity by making the empty-input behavior explicit, directly reflecting the single passing test. Though APP mass increases, the gain in readability justifies it at this stage.\n\n**Refactoring Complete**:\n- **Refactoring**: Applied — added explanatory conditional for empty input\n- **Mass Change**: 1 → 8 (increase, but justified by improved clarity)\n- **Tests**: All passing\n- **Rule Prioritization Followed**: Yes — Rule 2 (Reveals Intent) prioritized over APP mass and Rule 4"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_12-20-43_game-of-life-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_qwen3-235b/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: Return empty array for empty input\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/game-of-life.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/game-of-life.ts\nPassing tests: 1\nRecent Green phase: Return empty array for empty input\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784982186023},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f91218a35ca6e9b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/game-of-life