 Tests Pass - Verify all tests pass\n2. Reveals Intent - Improve clarity and naming\n3. No Duplication - Eliminate code duplication\n4. Fewest Elements - Minimize code elements\n\n### Step 4: Implement Refactoring\nMake one improvement at a time, keeping tests green.\n\n### Step 5: Calculate New APP Mass\nRecalculate mass after refactoring.\n\n### Step 6: Document Decision\nExplain refactoring outcome with before/after mass.\n\n## Output Format\n\n```\nRefactoring Complete:\n**Refactoring**: [summary of improvements]\n**Mass Change**: [before] -> [after] (delta [difference])\n**Tests**: All passing\n```\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":2431,"output":416,"cacheRead":6576,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":9423,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784982396561,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-ba8497ba-f5a5-4b61-ac19-4546a4d3ec13","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-b34670904869e668","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1410 bytes to .pi/skills/refactor/SKILL.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784982400844},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-89c3fc20e7df61bb","name":"run","arguments":{}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":43,"output":18,"cacheRead":9392,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":9453,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784982400845,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-f9d2ca81-d8cc-4ad7-925e-c16d899044e4","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-89c3fc20e7df61bb","toolName":"run","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tool run not found"}],"details":{},"isError":tru